Pro2 Nintendo Bridge for LCTech BL616

The Pro2 and Nintendo protocol behavior in this port is derived from the
Apache-2.0 project XinHeLianSheng-Pro2-Bridge by LeonChrome, branch
codex/v5.9.17-source-paced (commit 67d32f2).

The BL616 board, build, Bluetooth and CherryUSB integration is adapted from
the GPL-3.0-only project ds5dongle-bl618-opensource by sqlCRT, v3.17
(commit 1b29d44), and uses its Bouffalo SDK fork (commit 42c20811) as an
external build dependency. Consequently this combined port is distributed
under GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE for the complete terms. The Apache-2.0 license
for XinHeLianSheng-Pro2-Bridge remains available in that source repository.

